211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The YBX3 flameproof motor frame uses horizontal, fully distributed cooling fins with a narrowed central section. Fin spacing and concentric-ring arrangements are optimized, with four internal axial ventilation passages. Axially aligned fins at the winding ends increase heat-dissipation area. Corrosion-resistant protective treatments and surface coatings improve durability under climatic exposure. Dual-circuit cooling supports high power density and uniform internal temperature distribution, extending motor service life.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
