243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 125 0 R
/T (The motor frame and end shields are made of high-quality cast iron of grade HT250 or above, using established manufacturing processes. Each motor center height corresponds to a specific frame, with integral cast feet. The optimized frame design provides excellent strength and rigidity. The horizontally or vertically mounted cast-iron frame features full-length cooling ribs and four axial ventilation passages. Axial parallel cooling fins are arranged around the winding end regions inside the frame to increase heat-dissipation area. The terminal box can be mounted on either side of the motor. The drive-end and non-drive-end end shields have the same structure, with internal and external cooling ribs to improve rigidity and cooling performance \(Figure 5\).)
/E (The motor frame and end shields are made of high-quality cast iron of grade HT250 or above, using established manufacturing processes. Each motor center height corresponds to a specific frame, with integral cast feet. The optimized frame design provides excellent strength and rigidity. The horizontally or vertically mounted cast-iron frame features full-length cooling ribs and four axial ventilation passages. Axial parallel cooling fins are arranged around the winding end regions inside the frame to increase heat-dissipation area. The terminal box can be mounted on either side of the motor. The drive-end and non-drive-end end shields have the same structure, with internal and external cooling ribs to improve rigidity and cooling performance \(Figure 5\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
