endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (The motor external leads are reliably connected through terminals inside the terminal box \(Figure 7\). The main power terminal box is a flameproof cast-iron unit with an attractive, lightweight and standardized design. Protection up to IP55 is available. Its large interior provides adequate electrical clearance and creepage distance in accordance with relevant national standards. The inside is coated with anti-rust primer and corrosion-resistant paint.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
