2310 0 obj
<<
/Title (Rolling-bearing assemblies include the end shield, bearing housing, inner and outer covers, bearing, oil slinger, retaining ring, continuous oil supply and drainage devices, and bearing-temperature monitoring. Oil-cup lubrication uses lithium-based grease. V-type sealing rings prevent dust and water from entering the bearings, extending service life and lubrication intervals. The calculated bearing service life exceeds 100,000 hours.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2305 0 R
/Next 2311 0 R
>>
